{"id":3673,"date":"2017-05-09T13:29:44","date_gmt":"2017-05-09T17:29:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=3673"},"modified":"2017-05-09T13:29:44","modified_gmt":"2017-05-09T17:29:44","slug":"old-home-week-in-s-e-michigan","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/05\/09\/old-home-week-in-s-e-michigan\/","title":{"rendered":"Old Home Week in S.E. Michigan"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>We left our &#8220;old&#8221; home in Mount Gilead, OH on May 1st and headed north to Wixom, MI area where we stayed at Proud Lake Recreation Area State Park for the week. \u00a0Our intent was to relax and enjoy the spring weather and see some long-time friends while we were there. \u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/05\/02\/first-day-in-michigan-proud-lake-recreation-area\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">I wrote this earlier post with some pictures<\/a> of the park. \u00a0It was COLD and RAINY nearly all week, but we had a great time nonetheless because we were able to hook up with friends from WAY BACK.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3686\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3686\" style=\"width: 700px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2nd-Grade-Fosmoe-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-3686\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2nd-Grade-Fosmoe-1-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"525\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2nd-Grade-Fosmoe-1-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2nd-Grade-Fosmoe-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2nd-Grade-Fosmoe-1-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2nd-Grade-Fosmoe-1.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3686\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Sandy is the first little girl in the bottom row, I&#8217;m the kid in the top row, 3rd from the right, striped long sleeve shirt<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3673 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-large'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-02-16.02.44.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-02-16.02.44-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3675\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-02-16.02.44-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-02-16.02.44-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-02-16.02.44-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-02-16.02.44.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3675'>\n\t\t\t\tHerb &#038; Kathy with Sandy (Overmeyer) &#038; Jeff Houghton &#8211; I&#8217;ve known Sandy since 2nd grade and Kathy &#038; I graduated with both Sandy and Jeff\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-03-17.59.47.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-03-17.59.47-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3676\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-03-17.59.47-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-03-17.59.47-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-03-17.59.47-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-03-17.59.47.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3676'>\n\t\t\t\tVisiting Frank &#038; Lora Schenk in Brooklyn MI (used to be neighbors in Redford)\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-04-17.25.44.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-04-17.25.44-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3677\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-04-17.25.44-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-04-17.25.44-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-04-17.25.44-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-04-17.25.44.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3677'>\n\t\t\t\tEric &#038; Nancy Jones (met in Redford Jaycees in 1972)\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-05-13.38.24.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-05-13.38.24-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3678\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-05-13.38.24-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-05-13.38.24-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-05-13.38.24-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-05-13.38.24.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3678'>\n\t\t\t\tw\/ Tim Galea (met in Redford Jaycees in early &#8217;70&#8217;s\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-05-19.19.08.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-05-19.19.08-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3679\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-05-19.19.08-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-05-19.19.08-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-05-19.19.08-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-05-19.19.08.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3679'>\n\t\t\t\tKathy&#8217;s sister&#8217;s (Linda) family .. Eric, Herb, Lindsey, Mike, Kathy, Linda\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>We had wonderful visits with old friends. \u00a0Some of these folks we haven&#8217;t seen in 30 or 40+ years. \u00a0Thanks to Facebook, we&#8217;ve been able to reconnect to lost friendships. \u00a0It&#8217;s so easy as we get busy with our; jobs\/kids\/school\/sports\/hobbies\/parents\/ etc. \u00a0to lose touch with those we once considered &#8220;very good&#8221; if not &#8220;best&#8221; friends.<\/p>\n<p>We left Proud Lake on Sunday May 7th and had two more visits on our agenda as we continued our travel north to Baldwin, MI for our summer workamping job.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3680\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3680\" style=\"width: 700px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/TripTik-Map-Proud-Lake-to-PMO-RV-Park.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-3680\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/TripTik-Map-Proud-Lake-to-PMO-RV-Park-1024x709.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"485\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/TripTik-Map-Proud-Lake-to-PMO-RV-Park-1024x709.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/TripTik-Map-Proud-Lake-to-PMO-RV-Park-300x208.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/TripTik-Map-Proud-Lake-to-PMO-RV-Park-768x532.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/TripTik-Map-Proud-Lake-to-PMO-RV-Park.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3680\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Trip Map From Proud Lake Rec Area to Delton, Spring Lake, Baldwin, MI<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Who&#8217;s in Delton you ask? \u00a0Thanks to Facebook, I was able to find George Williston. \u00a0I hadn&#8217;t seen or even talked to George since 1960 when my family moved from Detroit out to Redford Township. \u00a0I had attended Kindergarten and first grade in Detroit, where I met George. \u00a0I lived with my folks and two older sisters on Monte Vista and George lived with his family on Pinehurst, next street over on the other side of the alley. \u00a0George and I used the alley as the shortcut from his house to mine.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3681\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3681\" style=\"width: 949px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/13116-MonteVista.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3681\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/13116-MonteVista.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"949\" height=\"529\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/13116-MonteVista.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/13116-MonteVista-300x167.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/13116-MonteVista-768x428.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 949px) 100vw, 949px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3681\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">13116 Monte Vista, Detroit<br \/>The home I grew up in from 1954 to 1960 &#8211; Now just a shell<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>It&#8217;s a shame to see what the house and the neighborhood have become. \u00a0I have some great memories of that home, our neighbors (the McGraw family) where there&#8217;s now just an empty lot, and my time playing (and causing a little trouble I&#8217;m sure) with my best friend George Williston.<\/p>\n<p>Kathy and I met George and his wonderful wife Kelly where we enjoyed a light lunch in their beautiful home nestled in the woods. \u00a0In addition to having been a Wood Shop Industrial Arts teacher, George is also an accomplished writer. \u00a0 You can order his book &#8220;This Tribe of Mine&#8221; on Amazon.<\/p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 240px;\" src=\"\/\/ws-na.amazon-adsystem.com\/widgets\/q?ServiceVersion=20070822&amp;OneJS=1&amp;Operation=GetAdHtml&amp;MarketPlace=US&amp;source=ss&amp;ref=as_ss_li_til&amp;ad_type=product_link&amp;tracking_id=herbnkathy-20&amp;marketplace=amazon&amp;region=US&amp;placement=0981544509&amp;asins=0981544509&amp;linkId=9a42d00e92376d7984a4e7938aebcc91&amp;show_border=true&amp;link_opens_in_new_window=true\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>After our lunch and a nice walk around the property, we said goodbye to George and Kelly and headed further west and north to Spring Lake, Michigan where we met up with Brian Barker and his wife Connie. \u00a0Kathy and I went to Junior High and High School with Brian and we had a lot of great memories to talk about. \u00a0I had seen Brian and Connie when they lived in the Cincinnati area back a while but it&#8217;s been at least 20 years. \u00a0Kathy had never met Connie and hadn&#8217;t seen Brian in at least 35 years.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3685\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3685\" style=\"width: 503px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-07-17.32.07.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-3685\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-07-17.32.07-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"503\" height=\"283\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-07-17.32.07-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-07-17.32.07-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-07-17.32.07-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-07-17.32.07.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 503px) 100vw, 503px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3685\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Herb, Kathy, Brian, and Connie<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Brian and Connie live in a beautiful home just across from Spring Lake. \u00a0Great view and it&#8217;s easy to carry their kayaks over for an afternoon cruise.<\/p>\n<p>Again, it was great to spend time with old friends and catch up on some mutual memories.<\/p>\n<p>My next post will be an introduction to Baldwin, MI and Pere Marquette Oaks RV Resort.<\/p>\n<p>That&#8217;s all for now. \u00a0Stay happy.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We left our &#8220;old&#8221; home in Mount Gilead, OH on May 1st and headed north to Wixom, MI area where we stayed at Proud Lake Recreation Area State Park for the week. \u00a0Our intent was to relax and enjoy the spring weather and see some long-time friends while we were there. \u00a0I wrote this earlier &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/05\/09\/old-home-week-in-s-e-michigan\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Old Home Week in S.E. Michigan<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[406,677,19546,554707329],"tags":[554707354,554707352,554707231,554707349,554707350,130,554707353,554707351],"class_list":["post-3673","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-family","category-friends","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-baldwin","tag-delton","tag-friends","tag-old-friends","tag-redford-township","tag-school","tag-spring-lake","tag-wixom"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3673","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3673"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3673\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3688,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3673\/revisions\/3688"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=3673"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=3673"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=3673"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}